Practice Problem 1 (Easy)

👉 A switch is connected to PB1
👉 An LED is connected to PB4

Task:
	•	If switch = pressed → LED ON
	•	If switch = not pressed → LED OFF

👉 Write AVR program

SBI DDRB ,4
CBI DDRB ,1
SBI PORTB,1
LOOP:
     SBIS PINB,1 
     JMP LED_ON
     JMP LED_OFF
LED_ON:
        SBI PORTB,4
        JMP LOOP
LED_OFF:
        CBI PORTB,4
        JMP LOOP


SBI DDRB,4
CBI DDRB,1
SBI PORTB,1

LOOP:
SBIS PINB,1
RJMP LED_ON
RJMP LED_OFF

LED_ON:
SBI PORTB,4
RJMP LOOP

LED_OFF:
CBI PORTB,4
RJMP LOOP

Practice Problem 2 (Statement)

👉 LEDs are connected to PORTC

Task:
	•	Turn ON all LEDs connected to PORTC
	•	After a delay, turn OFF all LEDs
	•	Repeat this process continuously (infinite loop)

LDI R16,0xFF
OUT DDRC,R16
LOOP:
OUT PORTC,R16
RCALL DELAY
LDI R16,0x00
OUT PORTC,R16
RCALL DELAY
RJMP LOOP
DELAY:
LDI R17,0xFF
DEC R17
RET


